# the Israeli report (AnCora CESS-CAST-P-20010102-25), into Italian: each of
# these has its paradigm in apertium-spa.spa.dix and no English word.
# `el sepelio' is the funeral and `los colonos' the settlers -- both read
# into English only, `funeral' and `colonizador' stay the words written; `se
# clamó a la venganza' is cried out for revenge; `abatido a tiros' is felled
# by shots (the dictionary has `abatir' only as `knock down', two words); and
